suspend it: 0x00000001
while its delay runs: its status: 0x00000008
while its delay runs: its wait type: 0x00000001
after its delay ended: its status: 0x00000100
after its delay ended: its wait type: 0x00000000
after its delay ended: the callback got past the delay: 0x00000000
after its delay ended: the delay has returned a result: 0x00000000
resume it: 0x00000000
after the resume: the callback got past the delay: 0x00000001
after the resume: the runs of the callback: 0x00000001
after the resume: its wait type once it waits again: 0x80000020
after the resume: the delay's result: 0x00000000
its semaphore wait's result: 0x00000000
DONE
